<view class="page"><view class="demo">本机预约演示 · 时间均为上海时间</view><view class="title">约一个护理时间</view><view class="rule">可约时段仅反映已确认预约。提交后需店长再次核对，不代表预约已确认。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在查询时段…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{ready}}"><view class="label">护理项目</view><picker range="{{services}}" range-key="name" value="{{serviceIndex}}" bindchange="serviceChange">{{services[serviceIndex].name}} · {{services[serviceIndex].duration}} 分钟</picker><view class="label">日期 · 未来 30 天</view><picker mode="date" value="{{day}}" bindchange="dateChange">{{day}}</picker><view class="grid"><view wx:for="{{slots}}" wx:key="value" class="pill {{selected===item.value?'selected':''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="select">{{item.label}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!slots.length}}" class="empty">这天暂无可约时段，试试其他日期或联系店长。</view><view class="label">备注（可选，不填写健康诊断）</view><textarea class="field" maxlength="300" data-field="note" bindinput="input" value="{{note}}" placeholder="例如：希望安静休息"/><button bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy||!selected}}" loading="{{busy}}">提交预约申请</button></view></view>
